    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "📄 AUTOMATED INVOICE OCR & RELATIONAL ACCOUNTING PIPELINE\n\nSystem Summary:\nAn enterprise-grade, event-driven accounting pipeline built in n8n. Automatically ingests incoming PDF invoices, performs AI classification/OCR data extraction using OpenAI (GPT-4o), and maps parent invoice headers along with child line items into a relational Notion database.\n\n\n💼 BUSINESS VALUE & IMPACT\n\n• 100% Data Entry Automation: Eliminates manual data processing for vendor invoices and receipts.\n• Relational Audit Readiness: Maintains strict parent-child relationships between invoice headers and individual line items in Notion.\n• Zero Hallucination Guarantee: Enforces strict JSON Schema outputs to guarantee 100% financial data accuracy ($Gross = Net + VAT$).\n• Storage Optimization: Automatically purges non-invoice attachments to keep Drive storage clean.",
        "height": 416,
        "width": 896,
        "color": "#7ABFCD"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -2128,
        -752
      ],
      "id": "81d76e4b-1e8f-424e-af86-7b14dbb8d234",
      "name": "Sticky Note6"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "🛡️ RELIABILITY & FAULT TOLERANCE\n\n• API Rate Limit Protection: 3x retry policy with 2000ms backoff on Notion API loop iterations to handle '429 Rate Limit' responses.\n• Decoupled Error Handling: Linked to a global Error Trigger sub-workflow delivering real-time HTML incident alert emails with execution stack traces.\n• Input Data Sanitization: Normalizes currency codes (PLN, EUR, USD) and type-casts financial numbers before database mutation.",
        "height": 304,
        "width": 496,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        320,
        0
      ],
      "id": "a6539037-6c5b-430e-9a53-49239c9fa59e",
      "name": "Sticky Note7"
